		(layer "F.Cu")
		(uuid "ed252708-e8ef-4355-82b9-05ba1afc90b3")
		(at 109.9 71.4 90)
		(descr "Electrolitico SMD Panasonic tamano J16 (diam. 16 mm, base 17.0 x 17.0 mm, altura max. 17.3 mm). Land pattern 'Vibration-proof products' de Panasonic, J16: A 5.8 (separacion), B 7.0 (largo), C 6.2 (ancho con brazos), D 3.6, E 1.3, F 2.1, G 1.7, H 2.8 mm. La columna central (2.8 x 7.0 mm, separacion 5.8) contiene el land estandar J16 (a 6.0, b 6.9, c 2.5 mm): sirven EEE-FK1H102AM (estandar) y EEE-FK1H102AV (antivibracion, con terminales de soporte). Fuente: Panasonic Industry, Aluminum Electrolytic Capacitors (SMD Type) FK series, 'Land / Pad pattern', 01-Sep-25. https://industrial.panasonic.com/cdbs/www-data/pdf/RDE0000/ABA0000C1181.pdf")
